! mcp_bootstrap_p291.strap -- MCP printed page 291: the multi-unit
! count table SYNs (T CHADD, T CHCNT), the LOADER's data block (ABSSID
! .. ASEQID: card-type indicators SYN'd onto ALL, VF field pointers,
! counters and bounds), and the RESUME LOAD pseudo-op's opening (YRLTT
! .. B,YMPFCH), lines 1-51.
!
! docs/MCP_Mar63_250-445.pdf PDF p.42, read at 400 dpi, doubtful glyphs
! at 900 dpi.  Header, READ: "TIME CLOCK 00054041  PUNID 11D11MCP  CARD
! ID QE000194  DIST. OF 3/01  3/01  PAGE NUMBER 291" (round glyphs in
! numeric fields read 0).  The heading row's LOCATION field is BLANK
! (line 1 is a remark card).
!
! THE PAGE.  51 lines; every line number prints a "*" after it.
!   lines  1-5   remark cards (line 3 "SYN CARDS FOR THE MULTI-UNIT
!                COUNT TABLE"; line 5 prints a stray "." on the paper).
!   lines  6-7   T CHADD SYN(BU,18),0.0 / T CHCNT SYN(BU,4),0.20, as
!                IPL p.64 lines 45-46; print 000000.00+ / 000000.24+,
!                BINARY +00000000, dds BU,22,10 / BU,04,10.
!   lines  8-39  the loader's data: located rows contiguous from
!                232542.00 (line 8) to 232554.54 (line 39's 12-bit DRZ
!                ends there).  SYN rows print their value with "+" and a
!                dds; ALL's bits print N,100,04 (the (N) DRZ's dds, length
!                64, byte 4).  ALDBF SYN,YBCBU prints 231462.00+ BU,100,10.
!   lines 40-42  remark banner "******* RESUME LOAD PSEUDO OP. ****".
!   line  43     SLC,$ prints 232554.54 *.
!   line  44     CNOP prints no location (next row is 232555.00).
!   lines 45-49  YRLTT DD(BU,6),(8)04 prints "04" (6 bits); DRZ(BU,39),
!                (1) at 232555.06 prints 000000.47 (39 bits, the size);
!                EXT(0,18) prints no location; B,YRESLD at 232555.55
!                prints 0465340 = the 19-bit half-word address of YRESLD
!                (232560.00); DR(BU),(2) at 232556.00 prints 000002.00.
!                The same shape as p.265 lines 5-9 (YJC1TT).
!   lines 50-51  YRESLD LX,$1,YXWRLD; B,YMPFCH.  Last located row
!                232560.40 (a half word; next location 232561.00), then
!                blank paper.
! "*" after the LOCATION on lines 9, 32, 43, 46 and 49.
! DR/DRZ/SYN rows get no !CHECK (they print a size or a value, not
! code); their labels are !SYM-checked.
!
! JOIN.  p.290 (scratch neighbour, not landed) ends with T CHCUC
! DRZ(BU,32),(32) at 232522.00, next location 232542.00 -- this page's
! line 8: contiguous (the SYN rows 6-7 take no storage).  p.121's landed deck SYNs YRLTT at
! (8)232555.00 and p.271 (staged) SYNs ABSSID at (8)232542.0, which
! lines 45 and 8 define there -- independent witnesses of the
! placement.  p.292 should open at 232561.00 with serial QF000044.
!
! GLYPHS SETTLED BY OTHER THAN PLAIN INK:
!   * line 13 label prints "ADIGNI" (open round) = AOIGNI: C22-6728
!     "(i.e., AOIGNI=1)" -IGNORE CORRECTIONS; the use on PDF p.78 reads
!     BB,AOIGNI.
!   * line 16 label prints "ACCRDI" = ADCRDI: the uses on PDF p.78
!     (BB,ADCRDI,$+3.) and PDF p.80 (CM1111(BU,1),ADCRDI) print the
!     second glyph with a straight D stem at 900 dpi; C22-6728 names the
!     D-card routine ADCARD beside APCARD/ATCARD (APCRDI, ATCRDI here).
!   * lines 23-24 labels print "ACPT12" / "ACPT24" = AOPT12 / AOPT24:
!     the uses on PDF p.79 (V+,$1,AOPT12 three times) and PDF p.80
!     (V+,1,AOPT24) print the second glyph CLOSED, rounded both sides
!     (no D stem).  LETTER O vs DIGIT 0 IS NOT SETTLED by ink; the
!     volume OCR reads A0PT12 twice, AOPT24 once.  Written letter O.
!   * line 27 "ARCDCT" (third glyph open): C22-6728 "ARCDCT - loader
!     card counter for BSS jobs".
!   * line 32 "AACD" = AADD: volume OCR of the uses reads AADD five
!     times; comment "-USED IN ADCTAL ROUTINE" = AOCTAL (C22-6728).
!   * lines 34-35 "ALCCTR"/"ALCTC" = ALDCTR / ALDTC: C22-6728 (ALDCTR x5,
!     ALDTC x3); line 35's operand prints ALDCTR the same way.
!   * line 36 "ALCWWD" = ALOWWD: comment "-PROGRAM LOW BOUND"; the
!     volume OCR of a later use reads KV,$1,ALOWWD.
!   * line 6 label "T CHADC" = TCHADD (landed p.64/p.73); "C.C" = 0.0.
!   * lines 27-28 "VF,C" = VF,0 (prints 000000.00+).
!   * line 51 byte prints "CO" = 00 (B,; the octal fields of this page
!     print 0 open throughout); assembles 231141.10 00.
!   * line 8 "(A*)DD(BU,48,6),BSS     *": measured at 900 dpi, the "*"
!     stands six cells after the last S -- BSS plus five blanks fills
!     the eight 6-bit characters.  Line 30's data is eight ")"s.
!
! EXTERNALS.  YXWRLD, YMPFCH (p.269) and YBCBU (p.274) are staged, not
! landed; values from those decks and this page's binary.
!
! CARD SERIALS.  QE000194 .. QE000200 on lines 1-7, then a NEW DECK:
! QF000001 on line 8 .. QF000040 on line 47; lines 47-48 (the EXT pair)
! share QF000040; lines 49-51 QF000041-QF000043.  None skipped.

YXWRLD  SYN(BU), (8)231163.0         ! p.269 line 41 XW (staged); LX line 50 231163.02, half word only
YMPFCH  SYN(BU,32,8), (8)231141.0    ! p.269 line 14 SC label (staged); B line 51 231141.10, half word only
YBCBU   SYN(BU), (8)231462.0         ! p.274 line 19 DR(BU),(15) (staged); ALDBF line 33 prints 231462.00+ BU,100,10, BIT-EXACT

! line  1  -
! line  2  - -------------------------------------------------------
! line  3  -                SYN CARDS FOR THE MULTI-UNIT COUNT TABLE
! line  4  - -------------------------------------------------------
! line  5  -
TCHADD  SYN(BU,18),0.0                                       ! line  6  -MULTI-UNIT CHAN ADDRESS
TCHCNT  SYN(BU,4),0.20                                       ! line  7  -NUMBER OF UNITS ON CHANNEL
        SLC, (8)232542.00
ABSSID  (A*)DD(BU,48,6),BSS     *                            ! line  8
ALL     DRZ(N),1                                             ! line  9
ATCRDI  SYN,ALL.1                                            ! line 10  -T CARD INDICATOR
ASTCRD  SYN,ALL.2                                            ! line 11  -SUPER T CARD INDICATOR
AHFWDI  SYN,ALL.4                                            ! line 12  -PARTIAL WORD INDICATOR
AOIGNI  SYN,ALL.5                                            ! line 13  -IGNORE CORRECTIONS ON CARD
APCRDI  SYN,ALL.6                                            ! line 14  -P CARD INDICATOR
ASETZI  SYN,ALL.7                                            ! line 15  -ZEROING INDICATOR
ADCRDI  SYN,ALL.8                                            ! line 16
AFPCI   SYN,ALL.9                                            ! line 17  -FORTRAN PROGRAM CARD INDICATOR
ARBCDI  SYN,ALL.10                                           ! line 18  -BINARY DATA CARD INDICATOR
ARBCRI  SYN,ALL.11                                           ! line 19  -RELOCATE RIGHTMOST 18 BITS AS COMMON
ANUBIT  SYN,ALL.15                                           ! line 20
APT1    VF,.1                                                ! line 21
APT3    VF,.3                                                ! line 22
AOPT12  VF,.12                                               ! line 23
AOPT24  VF,.24                                               ! line 24
APT168  VF,2.40                                              ! line 25
ABT31   VF,0.31                                              ! line 26
ARCDCT  VF,0                                                 ! line 27
ACNT    VF,0                                                 ! line 28  -USED IN ASETZ TO SAVE NO. WDS. TO BE LOADED
ALB     (A*)DD(BU,12,6),LB*                                  ! line 29
ATWSTA  (A*)DD(BU,48,6),))))))))*                            ! line 30
ARELOB  DRZ(BU,7),1                                          ! line 31
AADD    DRZ(N),1                                             ! line 32  -USED IN AOCTAL ROUTINE
ALDBF   SYN,YBCBU                                            ! line 33
ALDCTR  DRZ(N),1                                             ! line 34  -BINARY LOCATION COUNTER
ALDTC   SYN,ALDCTR.32                                        ! line 35  -OCTAL LOCATION COUNTER
ALOWWD  DRZ(BU,32),1                                         ! line 36  -PROGRAM LOW BOUND
AHGHWD  DRZ(BU,32),1                                         ! line 37  -PROGRAM HIGH BOUND
AHIWD   DRZ(BU,32),1                                         ! line 38  -HIGHEST LOC.OCCUPIED BY PROGRAM
ASEQID  DRZ(BU,12),1                                         ! line 39  -SEQUENCE COUNTER
! line 40  - ***********************************************************
! line 41  - *******  RESUME LOAD PSEUDO OP.  ***************************
! line 42  - ***********************************************************
        SLC,$                                                ! line 43
        CNOP                                                 ! line 44  (no location printed)
YRLTT   DD(BU,6),(8)04                                       ! line 45
        DRZ(BU,39),(1)                                       ! line 46
        EXT(0,18)                                            ! line 47
        B,YRESLD                                             ! line 48
        DR(BU),(2)                                           ! line 49
YRESLD  LX,$1,YXWRLD                                         ! line 50
        B,YMPFCH                                             ! line 51

!SYM TCHADD 000000.00
!SYM TCHCNT 000000.24
!SYM ABSSID 232542.00
!SYM ALL    232543.00
!SYM ATCRDI 232543.01
!SYM ASTCRD 232543.02
!SYM AHFWDI 232543.04
!SYM AOIGNI 232543.05
!SYM APCRDI 232543.06
!SYM ASETZI 232543.07
!SYM ADCRDI 232543.10
!SYM AFPCI  232543.11
!SYM ARBCDI 232543.12
!SYM ARBCRI 232543.13
!SYM ANUBIT 232543.17
!SYM APT1   232544.00
!SYM APT3   232544.40
!SYM AOPT12 232545.00
!SYM AOPT24 232545.40
!SYM APT168 232546.00
!SYM ABT31  232546.40
!SYM ARCDCT 232547.00
!SYM ACNT   232547.40
!SYM ALB    232547.71
!SYM ATWSTA 232550.05
!SYM ARELOB 232550.65
!SYM AADD   232551.00
!SYM ALDBF  231462.00
!SYM ALDCTR 232552.00
!SYM ALDTC  232552.40
!SYM ALOWWD 232553.00
!SYM AHGHWD 232553.40
!SYM AHIWD  232554.00
!SYM ASEQID 232554.40
!SYM YRLTT  232555.00
!SYM YRESLD 232560.00
!CHECK 232544.00 | 000000.01+ | line 21 APT1 VF,.1
!CHECK 232544.40 | 000000.03+ | line 22 APT3 VF,.3
!CHECK 232545.00 | 000000.14+ | line 23 AOPT12 VF,.12 (label printed "ACPT12")
!CHECK 232545.40 | 000000.30+ | line 24 AOPT24 VF,.24 (label printed "ACPT24")
!CHECK 232546.00 | 000002.50+ | line 25 APT168 VF,2.40
!CHECK 232546.40 | 000000.37+ | line 26 ABT31 VF,0.31
!CHECK 232547.00 | 000000.00+ | line 27 ARCDCT VF,0 (printed "VF,C")
!CHECK 232547.40 | 000000.00+ | line 28 ACNT VF,0 (printed "VF,C")
!CHECK 232555.00 | 04 | line 45 YRLTT DD(BU,6),(8)04 | 6
!CHECK 232555.55 | 0465340 | line 48 B,YRESLD under line 47's EXT(0,18) -- 19 bits, YRESLD's half-word address | 19
!CHECK 232560.00 | 231163.02 10 | line 50 YRESLD LX,$1,YXWRLD
!CHECK 232560.40 | 231141.10 00 | line 51 B,YMPFCH (byte prints "CO")
